{"id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-turing-machine.md","title":"有限描述随机访问图灵机及运行资源","display":"df-turing-machine — 有限描述随机访问图灵机及运行资源","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-turing-machine","aliases":["29-df-turing-machine"],"display":"df-turing-machine — 有限描述随机访问图灵机及运行资源","depends_on":["[[29-df-bool-const]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-turing-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine — 有限描述随机访问图灵机及运行资源"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b9525166bc5de094\" href=\"?note=b9525166bc5de094\" title=\"29-df-bool-const\">29-df-bool-const</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为串接；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup=2\">\\(\\sqcup=2\\)</span> 是工作带空白符，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\notin\\mathbb N\">\\(\\#\\notin\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是越界读标记。字符串和运行前缀从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起编号；描述及配置元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 投影、工作带编号从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 起；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\">\\([m]=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>机器有有限条半无限工作带，第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 条兼作二进制地址带；输入串及其二进制长度只读，均按地址访问，不计入工作空间。地址带计入空间；输出只追加，不可读取。数值长度的位表示及地址读取在下式中定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>描述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=(q,g,k,q_0,q_a,q_r,\\delta)\">\\(T=(q,g,k,q_0,q_a,q_r,\\delta)\\)</span> 的整数参数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\geq3,g\\geq3,k\\geq1\">\\(q\\geq3,g\\geq3,k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_T=[q]\">\\(Q_T=[q]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_T=[g]\">\\(\\Gamma_T=[g]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_0,q_a,q_r\\in Q_T\">\\(q_0,q_a,q_r\\in Q_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_a\\neq q_r\">\\(q_a\\neq q_r\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 是下式有限类型中的关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\">\\(c=(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\)</span> 表示配置。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w[a\\mapsto b]\">\\(w[a\\mapsto b]\\)</span> 为在参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 处以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 覆盖的函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\">\\(\\sup\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span> 中取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_P\">\\(\\mathbf1_P\\)</span> 为命题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的示性值。机器、配置、运行均为以下定义的对象，不从外部文件取得。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_T=\\pi_7(T)\">\\(\\delta_T=\\pi_7(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_0^T=\\pi_4(T)\">\\(q_0^T=\\pi_4(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T=\\pi_5(T)\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T=\\pi_5(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T=\\pi_6(T)\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T=\\pi_6(T)\\)</span>；各元组投影及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_T,\\mathcal J_T\">\\(\\mathcal I_T,\\mathcal J_T\\)</span> 对所有满足上述参数类型的候选描述定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,a\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,a\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^*\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathsf{Tape}_g\">\\(w\\in\\mathsf{Tape}_g\\)</span>；转移子句中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T\">\\(c=(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^\\prime\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T\">\\(c^\\prime\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)\\coloneqq\\max(1,\\lceil\\log_2(m+1)\\rceil),\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(m)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\left\\lfloor m/2^{\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)-1-i}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right\\rangle_{i&lt;\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)\\coloneqq\\max(1,\\lceil\\log_2(m+1)\\rceil),\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(m)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\left\\lfloor m/2^{\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)-1-i}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right\\rangle_{i&lt;\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tape}_g\\coloneqq\\{w:\\mathbb N\\to[g]\\mid|\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:w(i)\\neq\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\infty\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Tape}_g\\coloneqq\\{w:\\mathbb N\\to[g]\\mid|\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:w(i)\\neq\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\infty\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j(w)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:w(i)\\notin\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{addr}(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i&lt;j(w)}w(i)2^i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j(w)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:w(i)\\notin\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{addr}(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i&lt;j(w)}w(i)2^i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rd}(x,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x(a),&amp;a&lt;|x|,\\\\\\#,&amp;a\\geq|x|,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{rdlen}(x,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\lfloor |x|/2^a\\rfloor\\bmod2,&amp;a&lt;\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(|x|),\\\\\\#,&amp;a\\geq\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(|x|).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rd}(x,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x(a),&amp;a&lt;|x|,\\\\\\#,&amp;a\\geq|x|,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{rdlen}(x,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\lfloor |x|/2^a\\rfloor\\bmod2,&amp;a&lt;\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(|x|),\\\\\\#,&amp;a\\geq\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(|x|).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_T^\\circ\\coloneqq Q_T\\setminus\\{q_a,q_r\\},\\quad\\mathcal I_T\\coloneqq Q_T^\\circ\\times\\Gamma_T^k\\times(\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\#\\})^2,\\quad\\mathcal J_T\\coloneqq Q_T\\times\\Gamma_T^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\times\\{\\varepsilon,\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_T^\\circ\\coloneqq Q_T\\setminus\\{q_a,q_r\\},\\quad\\mathcal I_T\\coloneqq Q_T^\\circ\\times\\Gamma_T^k\\times(\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\#\\})^2,\\quad\\mathcal J_T\\coloneqq Q_T\\times\\Gamma_T^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\times\\{\\varepsilon,\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\coloneqq\\{T=(q,g,k,q_0,q_a,q_r,\\delta)\\mid q\\geq3\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq1\\land q_0,q_a,q_r\\in[q]\\land q_a\\neq q_r\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\mathcal I_T\\times\\mathcal J_T\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal I_T\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;(u,v)\\in\\delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\coloneqq\\{T=(q,g,k,q_0,q_a,q_r,\\delta)\\mid q\\geq3\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq1\\land q_0,q_a,q_r\\in[q]\\land q_a\\neq q_r\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\mathcal I_T\\times\\mathcal J_T\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal I_T\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;(u,v)\\in\\delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TM}_{det}\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\mid\\forall u\\in\\mathcal I_T\\;\\exists!v\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;(u,v)\\in\\delta_T\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{TM}_{det}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TM}_{det}\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\mid\\forall u\\in\\mathcal I_T\\;\\exists!v\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;(u,v)\\in\\delta_T\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{TM}_{det}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_T\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^*\\times Q_T\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathsf{Tape}_g^k\\times\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad q_T(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\coloneqq z,\\qquad h_i(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\coloneqq h_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Conf}_T\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^*\\times Q_T\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathsf{Tape}_g^k\\times\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad q_T(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\coloneqq z,\\qquad h_i(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\coloneqq h_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_T(c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists(z&#39;,\\bar b,\\bar d,e)\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;\\left[\\left((z,(w_i(h_i))_{i=1}^k,\\operatorname{rd}(x,\\operatorname{addr}(w_1)),\\operatorname{rdlen}(x,\\operatorname{addr}(w_1))),(z&#39;,\\bar b,\\bar d,e)\\right)\\in\\delta_T\\land c&#39;=(x,z&#39;,(\\max(0,h_i+d_i))_{i=1}^k,(w_i[h_i\\mapsto b_i])_{i=1}^k,o\\Vert e)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_T(c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists(z&#39;,\\bar b,\\bar d,e)\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;\\left[\\left((z,(w_i(h_i))_{i=1}^k,\\operatorname{rd}(x,\\operatorname{addr}(w_1)),\\operatorname{rdlen}(x,\\operatorname{addr}(w_1))),(z&#39;,\\bar b,\\bar d,e)\\right)\\in\\delta_T\\land c&#39;=(x,z&#39;,(\\max(0,h_i+d_i))_{i=1}^k,(w_i[h_i\\mapsto b_i])_{i=1}^k,o\\Vert e)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w_\\sqcup(j)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\mathrm{start}_T(x)\\coloneqq(x,q_0,(0)_{i=1}^k,(w_\\sqcup)_{i=1}^k,\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w_\\sqcup(j)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\mathrm{start}_T(x)\\coloneqq(x,q_0,(0)_{i=1}^k,(w_\\sqcup)_{i=1}^k,\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\{(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N\\land c_0=\\mathrm{start}_T(x)\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;c_{i+1}\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_T(c_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\{(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N\\land c_0=\\mathrm{start}_T(x)\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;c_{i+1}\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_T(c_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Time}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\mid(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Space}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{i=1}^k\\left(1+\\max_{0\\leq j\\leq m}h_i(c_j)\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ (c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Time}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\mid(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Space}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{i=1}^k\\left(1+\\max_{0\\leq j\\leq m}h_i(c_j)\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ (c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_T(x)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\;q_T(c_m)=q_a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_T(x)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\;q_T(c_m)=q_a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_T\\coloneqq\\{(x,o)\\in\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\;(q_T(c_m)\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\land\\pi_5(c_m)=o)\\},\\quad T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}_T\\coloneqq\\{(x,o)\\in\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\;(q_T(c_m)\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\land\\pi_5(c_m)=o)\\},\\quad T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐原 tm-computes、atm、complexity-classes 中明确称为外部原语的接口。有限转移表给出有限分支；停机状态无后继，非停机状态至少有一个后继。确定性使停机输出唯一。地址取第一条工作带最长二进制前缀，后续非二进制格不会使该地址不唯一；工作带有限支撑保证前缀结束。</p>\n<p>只读长度信息显式列出，避免亚线性时间界暗中依赖输入长度的获得方式。工作空间取所有有限运行前缀访问格数的上确界，时间取所有路径长度的上确界；无穷路径不被当成停机计算。此处给出的是数学模型及递归接口，不是机器证明证书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-bool-const","status":"resolved","id":"b9525166bc5de094","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-const]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqcup=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\notin\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"[m]=\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"T=(q,g,k,q_0,q_a,q_r,\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\geq3,g\\geq3,k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"Q_T=[q]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_T=[g]","display":false},{"tex":"q_0,q_a,q_r\\in Q_T","display":false},{"tex":"q_a\\neq q_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"c=(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)","display":false},{"tex":"w[a\\mapsto b]","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_T=\\pi_7(T)","display":false},{"tex":"q_0^T=\\pi_4(T)","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T=\\pi_5(T)","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T=\\pi_6(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_T,\\mathcal J_T","display":false},{"tex":"m,a\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathsf{Tape}_g","display":false},{"tex":"c=(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"c^\\prime\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)\\coloneqq\\max(1,\\lceil\\log_2(m+1)\\rceil),\\qquad\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(m)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle\\left\\lfloor m/2^{\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)-1-i}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right\\rangle_{i<\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(m)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tape}_g\\coloneqq\\{w:\\mathbb N\\to[g]\\mid|\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:w(i)\\neq\\sqcup\\}|<\\infty\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"j(w)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:w(i)\\notin\\mathbb B\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{addr}(w)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i<j(w)}w(i)2^i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rd}(x,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x(a),&a<|x|,\\\\\\#,&a\\geq|x|,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{rdlen}(x,a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\lfloor |x|/2^a\\rfloor\\bmod2,&a<\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(|x|),\\\\\\#,&a\\geq\\ell_{\\mathbb N}(|x|).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"Q_T^\\circ\\coloneqq Q_T\\setminus\\{q_a,q_r\\},\\quad\\mathcal I_T\\coloneqq Q_T^\\circ\\times\\Gamma_T^k\\times(\\mathbb B\\cup\\{\\#\\})^2,\\quad\\mathcal J_T\\coloneqq Q_T\\times\\Gamma_T^k\\times\\{-1,0,1\\}^k\\times\\{\\varepsilon,\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\coloneqq\\{T=(q,g,k,q_0,q_a,q_r,\\delta)\\mid q\\geq3\\land g\\geq3\\land k\\geq1\\land q_0,q_a,q_r\\in[q]\\land q_a\\neq q_r\\land\\delta\\subseteq\\mathcal I_T\\times\\mathcal J_T\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal I_T\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;(u,v)\\in\\delta\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TM}_{det}\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\mid\\forall u\\in\\mathcal I_T\\;\\exists!v\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;(u,v)\\in\\delta_T\\},\\qquad\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{TM}_{det}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_T\\coloneqq\\mathbb B^*\\times Q_T\\times\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathsf{Tape}_g^k\\times\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad q_T(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\coloneqq z,\\qquad h_i(x,z,\\bar h,\\bar w,o)\\coloneqq h_i.","display":true},{"tex":"c'\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_T(c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists(z',\\bar b,\\bar d,e)\\in\\mathcal J_T\\;\\left[\\left((z,(w_i(h_i))_{i=1}^k,\\operatorname{rd}(x,\\operatorname{addr}(w_1)),\\operatorname{rdlen}(x,\\operatorname{addr}(w_1))),(z',\\bar b,\\bar d,e)\\right)\\in\\delta_T\\land c'=(x,z',(\\max(0,h_i+d_i))_{i=1}^k,(w_i[h_i\\mapsto b_i])_{i=1}^k,o\\Vert e)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"w_\\sqcup(j)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\mathrm{start}_T(x)\\coloneqq(x,q_0,(0)_{i=1}^k,(w_\\sqcup)_{i=1}^k,\\varepsilon).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\{(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_T^{<\\omega}\\mid m\\in\\mathbb N\\land c_0=\\mathrm{start}_T(x)\\land\\forall i<m\\;c_{i+1}\\in\\mathrm{Succ}_T(c_i)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Time}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\mid(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Space}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{i=1}^k\\left(1+\\max_{0\\leq j\\leq m}h_i(c_j)\\right)\\ \\middle|\\ (c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_T(x)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\;q_T(c_m)=q_a.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_T\\coloneqq\\{(x,o)\\in\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists(c_0,\\ldots,c_m)\\in\\operatorname{Run}_T(x)\\;(q_T(c_m)\\in\\{q_a,q_r\\}\\land\\pi_5(c_m)=o)\\},\\quad T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}.","display":true}],"bytes":5456,"backlinks":[{"id":"77e57ed488a01e39","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}$ 取 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 的有限描述、配置和一步转移模型；$Q_T^\\circ=Q_T\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\\}$。"},{"id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TM}_{det},\\mathsf{TM}_{nd},\\operatorname{Acc}_T,\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\operatorname{Space}_T$ 由 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 定义。$\\mathcal M$ 取这两个机器集合之一，$r$ 取 $\\operatorname{Time}$ 或 $\\operatorname{Space}$；$C$ 取本条定义的查询类。$\\mathfrak O_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]。"},{"id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$，$L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*$。$\\mathsf{TM}_{det},\\operatorname{Time},\\operatorname{Acc}$ 取 [[29-df-turing-machine]]。$\\chi_A$ 是下式的全特征函数。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]、[[29-df-computability]]、[[29-df-resource-constructibility]] — 原计算原语的有限描述及明确资源接口。"},{"id":"166ecddb12d25dfc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"建议函数 $f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*$ 只依赖输入长度。$p\\in\\mathbb N[X]$；$\\ell_f,\\mathrm{Bit}_f$ 是下式定义的二进制语言。$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb B^*$ 取 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 的显式二进制表示，局部记号 $\\mathrm{bin}$ 在下式定义；$f(n)[i]$ 从 $i=0$ 起编号。"},{"id":"41143d1e9b3932ce","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}$ 取 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 的自然数二进制串函数。$\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{1},\\mathtt{000},\\ldots,\\mathtt{111}$ 是所显示的有限比特串，不是自然数；$\\operatorname{code}_B$ 的标签长度均为三位。$\\langle\\psi\\rangle$ 仅为下式编码函数的别名。"},{"id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$；$T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}$，$\\operatorname{out}_T,\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\operatorname{Space}_T,\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}$ 见 [[29-df-turing-machine]]。"},{"id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{out}}$ 及其配置、转移和输出由 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 定义；$\\operatorname{out}_T:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是其停机输出